All 20 canonical checks pass. Implementation complete in `grade_school.py`.

## What I implemented
- `add_student(name, grade)` — enrolls a student once across the whole roster; returns/records `True` on success, `False` on duplicate (same name, same or different grade).
- `roster()` — all students sorted by grade, then alphabetically by name.
- `grade(n)` — sorted names in grade `n`, `[]` if none.
- `added()` — ordered list of the boolean result of each `add_student` call.

